# Design examples only; not executed. No real token is stored here.
# Replace variables with your environment. Each genuinely new POST intent needs a new key.
@baseUrl = https://api.example.invalid
@accessToken = REPLACE_LOCALLY
@conversationId = REPLACE_WITH_CREATED_CONVERSATION
@runId = REPLACE_WITH_ACCEPTED_RUN

### 1. Library
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent-hub/agents
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. Create; returns revision=1 and ETag "1"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent-hub/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: example-conversation-001

{"title":"Phân tích nhà cung cấp","selected_agents":["database","prediction"]}

### 3. Send; use actual current conversation revision
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent-hub/conversations/{{conversationId}}/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: example-create-run-001

{"conversation_revision":1,"message":"Vẽ biểu đồ tỷ lệ giao trễ và so sánh đơn giá nhà cung cấp cho DEMO-P03.","timezone":"Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh"}

### 4. Activities; omit Last-Event-ID on first connection
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent-hub/runs/{{runId}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: text/event-stream

### 5. Authoritative result; do not parse chart data from streaming text
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent-hub/runs/{{runId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Selected/used/dependency agents
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent-hub/runs/{{runId}}/metadata
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent-hub/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. Change selection for the next run, with actual current ETag
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent-hub/conversations/{{conversationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "1"

{"selected_agents":["prediction"]}

### 9. Optional cancel during execution, not after successful terminal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent-hub/runs/{{runId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: example-cancel-run-001
